<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador May consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Ecuador May consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in May, the National Statistics and Census Institute said Friday:</p>
<p>    Food				     1.68 pct</p>
<p>    Clothing				 1.73 pct</p>
<p>    Housing				  1.49 pct</p>
<p>    Others				   1.38 pct</p>
<p>    Total				    1.53 pct</p>
<p>((-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
</text>
